<task id="006" project="spaarkeai-compose-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>Phase 0 GATE — schema + harness + applier spike green ⇒ authorize cutover (HARD go/no-go)</title>
    <phase>0 Gate</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>The hard-replace safety-net gate (NFR-08): a go/no-go judgment that authorizes irreversible old-path deletion (tasks 023, 032, 060). A wrong GREEN removes the safety net. Highest-consequence gate in the project.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>A go/no-go judgment gate weighing three evidence streams whose outcome authorizes irreversible deletion; demands the strongest judgment.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Gate judgment — a main-session sequential decision that reads the outputs of 003/004/005; not parallelizable.</parallel-reason>
